Add to construct-os-v2/.env:
  TREASURY_AGENT_URL=http://localhost:4001

Note: this fires alongside the existing arcSettler.releaseFunds() call,
which still releases funds from the escrow contract's own internal
balance as before. The Treasury Agent's settlement (via Circle, from its
own separate wallet) is an additional, independent USDC payment — this
is intentional: it demonstrates a genuine second, autonomous agent
transaction, not a replacement for the escrow's existing release.
